 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "My schedule is completely wrong for next week. The calendar is showing morning clinic hours on days I am off, and my afternoon block for admin work is missing entirely. Please fix my working hours and add the time off blocks as soon as possible.",
   "id": "gen-271",
   "subject": "Schedule hours incorrect"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support Team, I am writing to inquire about the proper procedure for handling medication out-of-stock notices and switching a patient to an alternative therapeutic agent. Could you please provide guidance on the pharmacy substitution messaging workflow within the platform? Thank you for your assistance.",
   "id": "gen-272",
   "subject": "Inquiry regarding medication substitution workflows"
  },
  {
   "body": "I am at my wit's end trying to book a recurring series for a patient who needs to come in every Tuesday. Every time I try to set up the repeating schedule, it throws an error about a conflict, even though the slot looks completely open on the main view. Then when I try to override it, the whole sequence breaks and I have to delete everything and start over. Can someone please tell me what I am doing wrong here?",
   "id": "gen-273",
   "subject": "Recurring appointments keep failing with conflict errors"
  },
  {
   "body": "We are trying to check a patient's prescription history from the state database, but an access error keeps popping up. How do we fix this?",
   "id": "gen-274",
   "subject": "Prescription history database access error"
  },
  {
   "body": "I have been trying to set up our patient portal so people can book routine visits online, but I am completely lost in the configuration menus. I want to make sure patients can only book specific types of appointments and only see certain providers, but whenever I test it, everything is wide open. Where in the settings do I restrict the visit types and provider availability for the online booking page?",
   "id": "gen-275",
   "subject": "Confused about online booking settings for specific providers and visit types"
  },
  {
   "body": "Some of our automated text and email reminders aren't going out to patients. Can you check why?",
   "id": "gen-276",
   "subject": "Reminder messages not delivering"
  },
  {
   "body": "Please let me know how to search the directory for a new pharmacy location and save it to our favorites list.",
   "id": "gen-277",
   "subject": "Pharmacy directory search"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support, our clinical team requires clarification regarding the management of out-of-stock medication alerts. Specifically, several providers have encountered situations where a prescribed drug is unavailable at the local pharmacy, and we need guidance on executing the proper substitution messaging workflow to switch agents efficiently. Please provide documentation or steps for our administrative and clinical staff.",
   "id": "gen-278",
   "subject": "Guidance requested for medication substitution and out-of-stock alerts"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, we are currently reviewing our recent financial reports and need assistance with managing and appealing a batch of denied insurance claims. Could you please provide instructions on how to properly attach supporting clinical documentation within the billing module and re-file these claims? Additionally, we would appreciate guidance on utilizing the built-in reporting tools to track recurring denial trends so we can prevent future rejections.",
   "id": "gen-279",
   "subject": "Assistance needed with insurance claim denials, appeals, and reporting tools"
  },
  {
   "body": "The text message reminders are not sending out properly for my clinic. I checked the settings page and the schedule, but patients are still saying they get nothing. Adjust the timing and fix the delivery failure right away.",
   "id": "gen-280",
   "subject": "Fix automated reminders"
  }
 ]
